1
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,930
Why aren't you saying anything?

2
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,440
What am I supposed to say?

3
00:00:25,730 --> 00:00:29,070
I thought you would have a lot to say

4
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,120
I guess it wasn't the case

5
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:36,120
There were many

6
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,910
Very much

7
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,210
But

8
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:47,090
Why aren't you saying anything?

9
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:51,630
Well...

10
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:54,720
To do that

11
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,730
It feels like too much time has passed

12
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,730
Why aren't you answering like this?

13
00:01:07,030 --> 00:01:08,940
Is something wrong?

14
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:19,830
- Gaeun

15
00:01:25,750 --> 00:01:28,550
It's been a while

16
00:01:29,710 --> 00:01:31,760
I know you won't forgive me

17
00:01:32,090 --> 00:01:32,550
But

18
00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:36,470
I wanted to apologize even now

19
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,180
Is it an apple?

20
00:01:41,270 --> 00:01:43,850
Do you know how I felt back then?

21
00:01:44,850 --> 00:01:46,770
Do you know how much I was suffering?

22
00:01:47,770 --> 00:01:48,650
Yumi

23
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:50,610
One day is worry

24
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:53,950
Another day is despair

25
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:57,530
Do you know that feeling of betrayal

26
00:01:57,530 --> 00:01:59,450
that comes again another day?

27
00:02:01,370 --> 00:02:03,960
I'm sorry, Yumi

28
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:06,290
No

29
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:08,460
Don't apologize

30
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:12,170
And don't ever show up in front of me again

31
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:17,970
Soon

32
00:02:21,060 --> 00:02:23,180
We will meet again

33
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,730
What?

34
00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:34,190
Let's talk about it again then

35
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,900
What is it?

36
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,780
I haven't heard from you

37
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,860
Do you know how long I've been waiting?

38
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:22,780
I'm sorry

39
00:03:24,290 --> 00:03:26,040
Did you wait a long time?

40
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:30,960
Can't you at least get in touch?

41
00:03:31,540 --> 00:03:33,300
What happened?

42
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:40,340
It's because of work

43
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:46,100
If it's work, can't it be done tomorrow as well?

44
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:48,270
Work is more important than me...

45
00:03:48,270 --> 00:03:49,060
Ga-eun

46
00:03:49,650 --> 00:03:50,650
I'm sorry, but

47
00:03:52,230 --> 00:03:54,400
I'm really tired right now

48
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:57,490
Can we talk tomorrow?

49
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:01,780
Yes

50
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,980
Is something wrong?

51
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:38,360
No

52
00:04:39,150 --> 00:04:41,450
Nothing at all

53
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:46,700
If it's hard, don't suffer alone

54
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,620
Please tell me

55
00:04:49,540 --> 00:04:51,170
Got it?

56
00:05:07,220 --> 00:05:08,520
Gaeun

57
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:11,730
I'm sorry

58
00:05:15,270 --> 00:05:16,820
I'm sorry too

59
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:19,440
For complaining earlier

60
00:05:21,110 --> 00:05:23,110
If something happens

61
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:27,200
Make sure to tell me, okay?

62
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:30,450
Got it
